    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law, the public officers law and the general municipal law, in relation to establishing in the counties of Nassau and Suffolk a demonstration program implementing speed violation monitoring systems in school speed zones by means of photo devices, and in relation to photo speed violation monitoring systems in school speed zones in the city of New York; and providing for the repeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof",
